                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That same day the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Go to the Abarim Mountains in the land of Moab opposite the city of Jericho; climb Mount Nebo and look at the land of Canaan that I am about to give the people of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will die on that mountain as your brother Aaron died on Mount Hor, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because both of you were unfaithful to me in the presence of the people of Israel. When you were at the waters of Meribah, near the town of Kadesh in the wilderness of Zin, you dishonoured me in the presence of the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will look at the land from a distance, but you will not enter the land that I am giving the people of Israel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.52"
            ]
          }
        }
